|CKBMonk|000

|CK0Monks are ascetic martial artists who turn body, breath, and discipline
into weapons. They give up wealth, heavy equipment, marriage, oaths, and other
ordinary ambitions for bare-handed combat, Chi, styles, and chained
techniques.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Chi fuels abilities and inner defense. Techniques create combo tags and
flow from opener to bridge to finisher; changing among tiger, crane, snake,
monkey, and dragon styles alters how those routes behave. Training and challenge
award notches along a long path toward mastery.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0meditate and chifocus manage Chi, opunch and ckick begin martial routes,
grapple and lsweep control opponents, chiblast projects force, resuscitate aids
an ally, and tdeath represents the lethal end of the discipline.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Monk if you want deliberate melee combos, resource timing, style
switching, and strong thematic restrictions. Do not choose it for wealth,
heavy armour, or effortless weapon swapping.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBmonkhelp basics|CK0, |CKBmonkhelp chi|CK0, and
|CKBmonkhelp combos|CK0 for the complete discipline.|000

